{"id": "city-college-distance-education-apportionment", "title": "How missing hybrid-course records became a $24.8 million City College debt", "seconds": 72.1, "voice": "elevenlabs:exurTFaGNF2gnRcPNH8I", "narrator": "Phil", "made": "2026-11-27", "key": "8a4bad6f59af908e", "words": 193, "beats": [{"scene": "classes", "kind": "hook", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "Accountants later reviewed hybrid courses offered from 2011 through 2014.", "t0": 0.2, "t1": 5.16, "shot": "r0", "visual": {"type": "hook", "words": ["What", "counts", "as", "attendance?"], "sub": "San Francisco City College"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.59, 0.87, 1.27, 1.68, 2.23, 2.66, 2.87, 3.22, 3.55, 3.79, 4.08]}, {"scene": "classes", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "One part met on a schedule. Students arranged the other activity individually.", "t0": 5.28, "t1": 9.31, "shot": "r1", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "review", "kicker": "Vavrinek, Trine, Day & Co., filed with the CCSF Board of Trustees", "text": "Course structure and scope", "mark": "Course structure and scope"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.23, 0.49, 0.67, 0.79, 0.86, 1.86, 2.25, 2.6, 2.72, 2.93, 3.39]}, {"scene": "classes", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "The college claimed 5,850.38 full-time-equivalent units of enrollment.", "t0": 9.43, "t1": 14.93, "shot": "r2", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "5,850.38", "label": "Full-time-equivalent enrollment claimed over three years"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.51, 0.88, 1.15, 1.63, 1.83, 2.17, 2.49, 2.81, 3.05, 3.29, 4.29, 4.56, 4.66]}, {"scene": "classes", "kind": "record", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "For most units, the college supplied neither participation records nor instructions.", "t0": 15.05, "t1": 18.92, "shot": "r3", "visual": {"type": "record", "layout": "relationship", "context": "Three years of code X courses", "heading": "Which records could reviewers find?", "source": "review", "rows": [{"icon": "file", "label": "No participation records", "value": "5,381.05"}, {"icon": "file", "label": "Participation found", "value": "469.33"}]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.17, 0.43, 0.76, 0.92, 1.27, 1.67, 1.95, 2.6, 2.96, 3.14]}, {"scene": "classes", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "For the rest, participation was documented. The college lacked centralized records of instructions.", "t0": 19.04, "t1": 25.0, "shot": "r4", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "review", "kicker": "Vavrinek, Trine, Day & Co., filed with the CCSF Board of Trustees", "text": "Participation and instructions", "mark": "Participation and instructions"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.2, 0.33, 0.94, 1.66, 1.82, 3.33, 3.51, 3.93, 4.21, 4.8, 5.16, 5.26]}, {"scene": "funding", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "For the base year, 1,804.28 units lacked participation records.", "t0": 25.22, "t1": 30.97, "shot": "r5", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "1,804.28", "label": "Enrollment units without participation records in the base year"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.18, 0.3, 0.62, 1.47, 1.71, 2.19, 2.41, 2.78, 3.03, 3.29, 3.47, 3.71, 4.25, 4.59, 5.31]}, {"scene": "funding", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "Later funding floors started at one hundred percent of that base, then declined.", "t0": 31.09, "t1": 35.36, "shot": "r6", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "law", "kicker": "California Legislature", "text": "California funding floors", "mark": "California funding floors"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.35, 0.69, 1.0, 1.38, 1.53, 1.74, 2.02, 2.34, 2.44, 2.63, 3.27, 3.5]}, {"scene": "funding", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "The district first estimated it owed the state nearly thirty-nine million dollars.", "t0": 35.48, "t1": 39.57, "shot": "r7", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$38.9 million", "label": "District’s initial repayment estimate"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.52, 0.84, 1.41, 1.56, 1.77, 1.88, 2.23, 2.53, 3.02, 3.32]}, {"scene": "funding", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "The accreditor reported a repayment agreement of $24.8 million.", "t0": 39.69, "t1": 43.72, "shot": "r8", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$24.8 million", "label": "Agreement reported by the accreditor"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.12, 0.65, 1.05, 1.14, 1.58, 2.01, 2.14, 2.65, 2.92, 3.15, 3.51]}, {"scene": "funding", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "California took repayments from state aid. The term was extended through fiscal 2030.", "t0": 43.84, "t1": 48.93, "shot": "r9", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "accredit", "kicker": "Accrediting Commission for Community and Junior Colleges", "text": "State funding deductions", "mark": "State funding deductions"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.58, 0.79, 1.3, 1.51, 1.85, 2.67, 2.87, 3.16, 3.32, 3.76, 4.01, 4.4, 4.72]}, {"scene": "repayment", "kind": "record", "ref": ["suspicious[4]", "established[4]"], "text": "The audited balance dropped from roughly eleven million dollars to just over nine million.", "t0": 49.15, "t1": 53.56, "shot": "r10", "visual": {"type": "record", "layout": "amounts", "context": "Audited June balances", "heading": "The district’s liability declined", "source": "audit25", "rows": [{"icon": "file", "label": "June 2024", "value": "$11,172,918"}, {"icon": "file", "label": "June 2025", "value": "$9,310,765"}]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.16, 0.59, 1.0, 1.32, 1.51, 1.9, 2.24, 2.54, 2.94, 3.1, 3.37, 3.66, 3.97]}, {"scene": "repayment", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[4]", "established[4]"], "text": "Then California itself recorded the ninth payment as a deduction from state aid.", "t0": 53.68, "t1": 58.12, "shot": "r11", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "state26", "kicker": "California Community Colleges Chancellor’s Office", "text": "State Exhibit C, San Francisco", "mark": "State Exhibit C, San Francisco"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.19, 0.76, 1.22, 1.65, 1.78, 2.09, 2.51, 2.71, 2.8, 3.3, 3.51, 3.83]}, {"scene": "repayment", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[4]", "established[4]"], "text": "That deduction was nearly one point nine million dollars. Four more installments were scheduled.", "t0": 58.24, "t1": 63.39, "shot": "r12", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$1,862,153", "label": "FY2025–26 deduction recorded by California"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.2, 0.67, 0.83, 1.16, 1.38, 1.67, 1.93, 2.26, 3.48, 3.78, 3.97, 4.49, 4.63]}, {"scene": "repayment", "kind": "unknowns", "ref": ["notEstablished[0]"], "text": "The record establishes a documentation failure. It leaves open what instruction took place.", "t0": 63.51, "t1": 68.67, "shot": "r13", "visual": {"type": "unknowns", "cards": ["Instruction actually provided", "Individual intent"]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.17, 0.49, 1.1, 1.2, 2.0, 3.0, 3.19, 3.46, 3.79, 3.95, 4.46, 4.69]}, {"scene": "repayment", "kind": "end", "ref": ["status"], "text": "Every source is linked in the case file below.", "t0": 68.79, "t1": 71.16, "shot": "r14", "visual": {"type": "end"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.32, 0.72, 0.94, 1.27, 1.38, 1.49, 1.76, 2.01]}], "format": 6, "chapters": {"classes": "What the records could support", "funding": "The base year changed later funding", "repayment": "Follow the deduction"}, "look": "midnight", "hook": "question"}